{"firma": "01c42f12e3daef3b4e489b9412378d80fca72eb5", "file": "text.hsp", "riga": 2746, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "ヨウィンの村が見える。懐かしい土の匂いがする。", "jp_grezzo": "\"ヨウィンの村が見える。懐かしい土の匂いがする。\"", "en": "You see a small town, Yowyn. You fondly remember the smell of the soil.", "en_grezzo": "\"You see a small town, Yowyn. You fondly remember the smell of the soil.\"", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Si vede il villaggio di Yowyn. Si sente un familiare odore di terra."}
